# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — OFFLINE FLASHCARD & QUIZ ANDROID APP

## PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete Android application for studying, memorizing, revising, and testing knowledge using Flashcards and Multiple Choice Quizzes.

The application must provide four methods of creating Flashcards:

1. Manual Question–Answer Creation
2. Automatic Flashcard Generation from Images / Photos
3. Bulk Flashcard Import using JSON / CSV Files
4. Automatic Flashcard Generation from PDF Notes / Books

The application must be completely offline. All data, processing, learning progress, quizzes, statistics, imports, OCR, and backup operations must work locally on the Android device.

The application must be a functional Android app, not merely a UI prototype.

